## Title: Forpl KDA Bar
## Author: brady
## Version: 1.0.0
## AddOnVersion: 100
## APIVersion: 101050
## SavedVariables: KDABannerSavedVars
## Description: On-screen Kill / Death / Assist counter for PvP. Kills come from your PvP killing blows; assists from any enemy you damaged that then dies. Configure it in Settings > Add-Ons, or move/show it with keybinds.
## OptionalDependsOn: LibAddonMenu-2.0

; LibAddonMenu-2.0 is OPTIONAL (and never hides this addon if it is missing).
; When installed it adds a panel under Settings > Add-Ons to change position and
; toggle the bar on/off (on console LAM bridges this to LibHarvensAddonSettings).
; Without it, the addon still works and is moved/shown via keybinds
; (Settings > Controls > Keybindings > Forpl KDA Bar) or the /kda slash command.
Bindings.xml
KDABanner.lua
KDABanner_Settings.lua
